  "description": "A customer reports failed invoice downloads. Support assesses the incident, Engineering restores service, and the customer confirms recovery. Compare a first-attempt repair with a retry. Responsibility lanes show handoffs; phase groups separate initial assessment and restoration from later verification, closure, and queued prevention work.",
  "overview": "These synthetic recordings contrast a repair that passes its first health check with a repair that needs another attempt. Each incident reaches customer-confirmed recovery and queues a prevention task. Queuing that task does not mean the preventive work is complete. Read the comparison, then follow either recording through assessment, restoration, and verification.",
